<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telco Comm started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telco Comm started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Michele Wolf said she initiated coverage of Telco Communications Group Inc with an attractive rating and a year-end price target of $28.</p>
<p>-- Set earnings per share estimates of $0.17 for the first quarter and $0.97 for full-year 1997. Set 1998 estimate at $1.40.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed Monday at 21.</p>
</text>
